.SH config
~/.config/venti/config.toml

sections: [general] [profile] [layout] [input] [decorations] [animation] [ui] [theme] [binds]

[profile] mode: "beginner" (default) | "hypr" | "vim" | "dev", four distinct keybinding personalities; f2 switches live

